<body lang=ZH-TW link="#4F81BD" vlink=purple style='word-wrap:break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<h1><a name=國中數學一2-2-公因數與公倍數-會考標準高鑑別度模擬試卷><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>國中數學（一）</span></a><span
lang=EN-US>2-2 </span><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>公因數與公倍數</span><span
lang=EN-US> — </span><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>會考標準高鑑別度模擬試卷</span></h1>

<p class=FirstParagraph><b>範圍</b>：翰林／康軒／南一通用版<span lang=EN-US> 2-2 </span>公因數與公倍數（含課堂補充紅字重點）<span
lang=EN-US><br>
</span><b>總題數</b>：<span lang=EN-US>50 </span>題（單選題<span lang=EN-US> 25 </span>題、填充題<span
lang=EN-US> 15 </span>題、計算題<span lang=EN-US> 10 </span>題）</p>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<h2><a name=第一部分綜合模擬試卷共-50-題><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>第一部分：綜合模擬試卷（共</span></a><span
lang=EN-US> 50 </span><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>題）</span></h2>

<h3><a name=一單選題每題-2-分共-25-題每題只有一個最適當的選項><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>一、單選題（每題</span></a><span
lang=EN-US> 2 </span><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>分，共</span><span
lang=EN-US> 25 </span><span style='font-family:"新細明體",serif'>題，每題只有一個最適當的選項）</span></h3>

<p class=FirstParagraph><span lang=EN-US>(</span>　<span lang=EN-US>) <b>1.</b> </span>設
<span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;position:
relative;top:2.5pt'><img width=59 height=29
src="國中數學2-2_公因數與公倍數_會考模擬試卷50題_原生公式版.files/image001.png"></span><span
lang=EN-US> </span>均為正整數，且 <span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;position:
relative;top:2.5pt'><img width=401 height=29
src="國中數學2-2_公因數與公倍數_會考模擬試卷50題_原生公式版.files/image002.png"></span>，則 <span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;position:
relative;top:2.5pt'><img width=105 height=29
src="國中數學2-2_公因數與公倍數_會考模擬試卷50題_原生公式版.files/image003.png"></span><span
lang=EN-US> </span>之值為何？<span lang=EN-US><br>
</span>　　<span lang=EN-US>(A) </span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;position:
relative;top:2.5pt'><img width=15 height=29
src="國中數學2-2_公因數與公倍數_會考模擬試卷50題_原生公式版.files/image004.png"></span>　　<span
lang=EN-US>(B) </span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;position:
